Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dope you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you so easily\Nforgotten that I bestowed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you with part of Emperor Crimson's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance to\Napply your unique talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have eulogy and the\Narms of Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm your senses and open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you have what it takes to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look at your immediate\Nsurroundings and peer into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,GameStop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream that's a dream\Nthat's a massive dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream that I'm dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.26,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just say, I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking. I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking. I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Break it and roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die. Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look carefully into the future\Nand predict that which shall be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The birds flew by just like I saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I think I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hard for me, but Eulogy found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy's blending into the\Ncliffs to stay out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't see him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My bare eyes are useless as\Nlong as he stays like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow he's also able\Nto disguise himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.34,0:02:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he's normally invisible, but\Nyou saw him because of your foresight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep look a few seconds ahead\Nand see how he's going to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is he's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some bad news,\Nboss. In ten seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,scissors are gonna rip\Ntheir way out of my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace, Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite appearances,\Nthat was not your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Risotto is the one defector\Nwho's eluded the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dealing with him will result in injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You must use those seconds\Nof knowledge granted to you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,by your foresight and deduce\Nhow he will attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Will do, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely moving in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's no way he's\Nusing a long-range stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And so if my vision from\Nthe future is showing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,a pair of scissors being\Nlodged in my throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean there's nothing I can\Ndo to change my destiny, boss? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must prepare for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no denying scissors\Nwill sprout from your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But see beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Discover the method behind his madness,\Nand his weakness is yours to exploit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you do, move within two meters and\Ndestroy him with Emperor Crimson's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,in all my years as a hitman,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,no one has ever been able to get\Nas close to yours truly as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done for a fledgling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, how did you know where I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your abilities are so unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, you must still die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he manage to get them under my skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't so much as laid a finger\Non me, and I'd never open my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember catching\Na glimpse of his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But these scissors are\Nopening up on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't act fast, he'll cut\Nsomething vital in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Those movements...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on track to bisect his trachea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But from the way he put\Nhis hands to his throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,he's acting as if he anticipated\Nthe scissors would be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My next strike needs\Nto put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat shit, Katsune!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is gonna lose his shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell does this guy just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, he really got me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting wobbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:06:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait that's what's wrong, Deep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you able to see Risotto's attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boss. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see it or didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your silence tells me you need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Provoke him into giving chase\Nand pinpoint his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fail me, you bastard! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for what may come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear he won't be\Nable to trick me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keikatsu, I'll get in range\Nif it's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor Crimson has provided you\Nwith yet another vision, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you a question, Deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My foot, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what he's gonna do next and\Nit's he's gonna go after my right foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And chop it off, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to prepare to lose my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say, Deep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him out of the corner of my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get to safety now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what the future holds,\Nso why aren't you moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Rysolto Niros.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A hitman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All of his movements are calculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows how he'll kill me,\Ndown to the last detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even move my legs right\Nnow, so running won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Razors, now scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew all of this would exhaust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He was planning for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dopio's chance at victory is shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and it would take longer than\Nten seconds to reveal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mysteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing a foot would be lethal\Nat this point in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding a way to minimize\Nthe damage is our best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, get the hell out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to slaughter you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean no disrespect by saying this, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I try escaping,\Nhe'll kill me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:07:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying put will help me\Nfigure out how he attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been consumed with thoughts\Nof him attacking me with
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,razor blades and those damn\Nscissors he stabbed me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I went about it the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,His ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He uses the iron that's in people's bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and turns it into razor blades\Nthat attack from the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That would explain my exhaustion\Nand the frog bursting into blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you figured out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You use your stand ability\Nto suck the iron nutrients
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,out of living things so you\Ncan make razor-sharp objects!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And since the blades shot\Nout of the frog first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of affecting us at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,you are creeping toward\Nme from over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that brick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That vision from the future was spot on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone did lose a foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey boss, I'm beginning to\Nget how this hitman operates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We may actually come out\Nof this in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did my phone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's just a frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how the heck did it\Nget all the way down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's underneath all these\Nrocks and covered in sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get to the phone\Nand report back to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, did it break?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing how they can get these\Nphones so small yet so sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You would be proud, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Doppio Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravissimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I be the one to\Nput an end to this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would it be better to\Nwait for you to arrive, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The death of Rizotomiro must be swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll snuff out the swine myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but you must be within two\Nmeters for us to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall join you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job in the meantime is to get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something inside the leg\Nwound, and they're squirming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Risotto's stand must live\Ninside of him. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the power to divine the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what will be and\Nread my movements accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way you could have\Nknown how I'd attack or from where.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, I surmised you were\Nnothing more than a helpless coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, it's like you're\Na different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You stand here before me undaunted\Nwith self-assured ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is different too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't the eyes of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's like there are two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that be what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But now there's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm closer than I originally thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Closer to the very person I've\Nbeen trying to track down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been two years since\Nyou turned us into a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,bunch of frightened mutts\Nwaiting to be put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the hell you are, it's far\Nmore than our group bargained for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know your true persona,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll do whatever I have to\Ndo to uncover your identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Solido Naso.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the boss's aliases, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell else would he try\Nhiding his daughter so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So we dragged our asses all\Nthe way out here for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we can get our\Nhands on his daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we might be able to find\Nout who the boss really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.17,0:12:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the thing\Nwith Sorbet and Gelato,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been stuck here like rats in a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder who's even guarding his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Pericolo isn't a\Nstand user, maybe Polpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head over to Napoli\Nand ask him ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We should think through all our\Noptions before taking action.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm as angry as you are, but\Nforget about sorbet and gelato,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll meet the same end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure means certain death, so take heed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My blood's boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he who cannot control\Nhis emotions dies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He reattached the foot I cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was right about you, Risotto Nero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all about your\Nstandability and its magnetism.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you're able to control\Nyour stand from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You manipulated the iron\Ninside my body so that I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,hack it all up in the form\Nof those razor blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you make yourself disappear by\Ndrawing magnetized iron dust to your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you use it like camouflage\Nto blend into the environment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How very astute. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have figured out\Nhow my metallic operates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but it really makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're far too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage has already been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A fantastic element that\Nexists the world over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only is it prevalent in sand, but\Nit's also in mineral water and plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the healthy human body\Ncontains traces of iron as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew how he was going to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU CANNOT LET HIM HURT\NYOU ANYMORE, UNDERSTAND?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:15:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You deciphered my abilities\Nand managed to sever my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the damage has already been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do will change\Nthat immutable fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Amounts of iron can be\Nfound in great quantities
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,in plants like spinach\Nand organs like the liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's also a critical\Ncomponent of the bloodstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think happens when the\Nbody is suddenly stripped of its iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, your blood turns yellow,\Nfollowed by you meeting your maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The iron in your blood binds with\Nthe oxygen your body acquires through
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,breathing and carries it to all those\Nnooks and crannies inside your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Without it, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that life-giving oxygen can never reach\Nplaces like your fingertips and brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it another way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,now that you're nutritiously\Nbankrupt of iron,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,your body won't circulate oxygen no\Nmatter how hard you huff and puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll turn into a living\Ncorpse before dying outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, now that he's on\Ndeath's door, what shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just wait until you die naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Conversely, since I'm a little\Nshort on time at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps I should end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They're near the mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pujerati!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He finally showed himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia and Abakio are with him. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Abakio's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep, your next strike\Nmust be the killing blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your power to see\NRisotto's next attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already looking, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Risotto's gonna ambush\Nme from my right side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,he disappears!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see him anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see, Deep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard won't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to me, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.10,0:16:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right before my vision becomes reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock that smug head off\Nhis shoulders and crush it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like when I sliced\Noff his nasty-ass butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stay still, Dobio!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Any act you make now will be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Conserve your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm traveling to your\Nlocation at this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In just a few seconds, I'll arrive to\Ndispose of Risotto. Few seconds? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have that kind of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be on top of me before I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I arrive, I'll use\Nmy time-removal powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll undo the horrid future\Nyou saw in your foresight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if he offs me before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to kill him! Deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live,\Nyou'll follow my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body has reached its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to\Nsabotage yourself in my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not understand\Nthe position you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Risotto Nero will not let\Nyou find him a second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I can find him, boss, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I said I had a way\Nto pinpoint his location?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I now know that the bastard's gonna attack\Nme by pulling the iron out of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.22,0:18:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is! His attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If his stand is strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,if it has enough power to pull\Nthe iron directly from my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,then the scalpel will show\Nme the source of that force!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha now, Risoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so painfully predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew magnetic fields attract iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and thought if you detected the origin\Nof the field, you could track me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was foolish, as the reality is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What you detected was the magnetic field
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,given off by my stand\Nin the foot you severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't notice, but I left it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I did a lot of soul searching after\NI was separated from my foot and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,knew I had to make the best of this\Nsituation if I were to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body is essentially\Ndevoid of oxygen at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned, the damage\Nhas already been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't even be able to twitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No more timid insecurity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's the change\Nin your physique and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,your peculiar habit of\Ntalking to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, I've figured\Nout your true identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,16th century German philosophers\Nknew the phenomena well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're clear it's called\Nmultiple personality disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to one's mental state,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes one will exhibit changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,like an increase in strength\Nor change in language.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I was foolish\Nenough to believe you were
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing more than the\Nboss's most trusted agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When death takes you away, what kind\Nof contorted grimace will you show?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm far enough back, and\Nyou've no power to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Any hope you had is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him to oblivion, Metallic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Risotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure that Doppio was aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I told the boy that he no longer\Nstood any chance against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy already beat us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, they're full of lead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for their ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've effectively\Nrobbed my blood of iron,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not transporting oxygen\Nto my organs like it should.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffice it to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,your power has made it seem as if\Nmy body isn't actually breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means the only thing Lil'\NBomber is currently tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So how many do the enemy number, Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one person\Nbreathing on that cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your stinking breath, Risotto?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.08,0:21:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How interesting what Doppio witnessed\Nwith his foresight actually came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory was within my reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But you had to throw the scalpels, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They were accusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not always with a knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is just fiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But they dare to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's bad and what's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.34,0:22:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.26,0:22:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.30,0:22:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.36,0:22:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.30,0:23:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you.
